ript truncation helper;\n- pinned a cross-runtime behavior fixture to the V4 reference commit and added a deliberate protected-field-drop mutant plus Hypothesis pressure coverage.\n\n## V4 oracle\n\nThe fixture is bound to `Pukujan/cortex-v4@923338c9c4c309ffadddd7805f4e5649006ede77`, specifically its stable task state, context controller, and memory-core tests. The port preserves behavior, not V4 file structure or runtime dependency.\n\n## Dependency\n\nThis PR is stacked directly on the green #3 head / `agent/walking-skeleton`.\n\n## Validation\n\nHosted `ci` passes on head `8b2b4c9453ecf739b36e325b62868a0749edf278`, including Ruff, strict Mypy, the inherited #3 regressions, V4 cross-runtime marker/offload behavior, fail-closed protected-state pressure, the deliberate protected-field-drop mutant, and Hypothesis-generated context pressure.\n\nDocs-Impact: none - #4 and the locked architecture already specify these stable-state/context invariants; this PR ports the reference behavior without adding a new provider or ownership boundary.","created_at":"2026-08-18T02:57:42Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T03:13:52Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"e5bd48353ca8ae7b9c7a604d19c5ccfe706510c6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pukujan/Cortex-v6/pulls/23/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pukujan/Cortex-v6/pulls/23/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pukujan/Cortex-v6/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pukujan/Cortex-v6/issues/23/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pukujan/Cortex-v6/statuses/8b2b4c9453ecf739b36e325b62868a0749edf278","head":{"label":"Pukujan:agent/v4-context-invariants","ref":"agent/v4-context-invariants","sha":"8b2b4c9453ecf739b36e325b62868a0749edf278","user":{"login":"Pukujan","id":137629468,"node_id":"U_kgDOCDQPHA","avatar_url"